    <bpmn:process id="W_W1892" name="W1892. Contractor Program Cost &amp; ROI Analysis" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly and annual program performance review
Frequency: Monthly dashboard; annual comprehensive ROI analysis
Volume: Total trade program covering ~5,200 accounts
Owner: FP&amp;A
Participants: FP&amp;A, VP Store Operations, CFO
Source: workflow W1892 — Contractor Program Cost &amp; ROI Analysis</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1892_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1892_Lane1" name="FP&amp;A">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1892_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1892_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1892_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1892_Lane2" name="CFO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1892_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1892_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1892_Start4" name="Monthly and annual program performance review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1892_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1892_Task5" name="Monthly: FP&amp;A compiles trade program cost dashboard: (a) trade discount cost…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Monthly: FP&amp;A compiles trade program cost dashboard: (a) trade discount cost: total discount amount as % of B2B revenue, (b) volume rebate accrual: total rebates earned/accrued, (c) loyalty points cost: points issued valued at PHP 1/point, (d) early payment discount cost, (e) promotional pricing cost, (f) referral bonus cost, (g) AM compensation allocation to trade program, (h) total program cost as % of B2B revenue, (i) trend: is program cost increasing or decreasing?
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 1 day/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1892_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1892_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1892_Task6" name="Annual: FP&amp;A conducts comprehensive ROI analysis: (a) total program cost vs…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Annual: FP&amp;A conducts comprehensive ROI analysis: (a) total program cost vs. B2B revenue growth, (b) B2B revenue growth rate vs. pre-program baseline, (c) B2B gross margin with program vs. estimated margin without program, (d) trade account retention rate vs. target, (e) new account acquisition rate and lifetime value, (f) program ROI: (incremental gross margin − program cost) ÷ program cost, (g) recommend program adjustments: benefit reductions if ROI &lt; 150%; benefit enhancements if ROI &gt; 300%
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 1 week/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1892_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1892_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1892_Task7" name="CFO presents annual program ROI to CEO and Board: (a) program financial…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: CFO presents annual program ROI to CEO and Board: (a) program financial performance, (b) competitive positioning, (c) recommended adjustments for next year
Responsible (R): CFO
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: 1 day/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1892_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1892_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1892_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1892_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1892_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-371 (ensure controlled execution — Contractor Loyalty, Incentive &amp; Volume Program (PA-43.2).) | - operational: standard operating procedures; system-enforced validation rules
Owner: FP&amp;A</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
