    <bpmn:process id="W_W1893" name="W1893. Contractor Loyalty Program Financial Governance &amp; Liability Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly financial close; annual loyalty liability review
Frequency: Monthly liability posting; annual review
Volume: ~5,200 accounts with cumulative points liability
Owner: Finance
Participants: Finance, VP Store Operations, External Auditor
Source: workflow W1893 — Contractor Loyalty Program Financial Governance &amp; Liability Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1893_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1893_Lane1" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1893_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1893_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1893_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1893_Lane2" name="External Auditor">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1893_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1893_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1893_Start4" name="Monthly financial close; annual loyalty liability review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1893_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1893_Task5" name="Monthly: Finance posts loyalty points liability: (a) Dr. Loyalty Program…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Monthly: Finance posts loyalty points liability: (a) Dr. Loyalty Program Expense / Cr. Deferred Revenue — Loyalty Points (for points issued during the month valued at redemption rate), (b) upon redemption: Dr. Deferred Revenue — Loyalty Points / Cr. Revenue (or contra-revenue), (c) estimate breakage: % of points that will never be redeemed based on historical pattern (typically 15–25% for trade programs)
Responsible (R): Finance
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Per W9A</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1893_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1893_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1893_Task6" name="Quarterly: Finance reviews loyalty liability adequacy: (a) total liability…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Quarterly: Finance reviews loyalty liability adequacy: (a) total liability balance vs. redemption trend, (b) is breakage estimate still appropriate? Adjust if actual redemption patterns change, (c) liability as % of B2B revenue — flag if &gt; 3% (program cost growing faster than revenue)
Responsible (R): Finance
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 1 day/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1893_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1893_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1893_Task7" name="Annual: External Auditor tests loyalty liability: (a) verify liability…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Annual: External Auditor tests loyalty liability: (a) verify liability calculation methodology, (b) test breakage assumption against historical data, (c) assess completeness of points outstanding
Responsible (R): External Auditor
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Per audit cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1893_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1893_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1893_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1893_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1893_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-371 (ensure controlled execution — Contractor Loyalty, Incentive &amp; Volume Program (PA-43.2).) | - operational: Finance review and approval gate
Owner: Finance</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
